DeterministicCommandEnvelope --> OperationNode : contains [1..*]
OperationNode --> OperationTargetSnapshot : resolves [0..1]
OperationNode --> ZoneInstance : may_create [0..*]

ActionA_FighterMultiActionTurn --> DeterministicCommandEnvelope : encoded_as_request
ActionB_CrowdControlVinesCasterTurn --> ZoneInstance : creates wall_of_thorns zone
ActionC_FireCircleTargetTurn --> ZoneInstance : creates wall_of_fire_ring zone
ActionI_MultiEffectSingleSpell --> ZoneInstance : creates dawn_cylinder zone

DeterministicOrderingPolicy --> OperationNode : deterministic graph order
DeterministicRngPolicy --> OperationLifecycleEvent : deterministic roll stream
StateRevisionPolicy --> ActionLifecycleEvent : revision tracking

Round01 --> ActionA_FighterMultiActionTurn : includes
Round01 --> ActionD_ConeAttackFromCaster : includes
Round01 --> ActionG_SummonEntity : includes
Round02 --> ActionB_CrowdControlVinesCasterTurn : includes
Round02 --> ActionC_FireCircleTargetTurn : includes
Round02 --> ActionE_CircleAoeWithRangeAndSize : includes
Round03 --> ActionH_TransformEntity : includes
Round03 --> ActionI_MultiEffectSingleSpell : includes
Round03 --> ActionF_SingleTargetRangedAttack : includes

ActionG_SummonEntity --> SummonLifecycleEvent : emits
ActionH_TransformEntity --> TransformLifecycleEvent : emits
ActionI_MultiEffectSingleSpell --> EffectLifecycleEvent : emits
ActionI_MultiEffectSingleSpell --> ZoneLifecycleEvent : emits

ActionA_FighterMultiActionTurn ..> CombatActionsDetailedRef : runtime ownership in
ActionI_MultiEffectSingleSpell ..> EventContractsDetailedRef : ordering contract in

